WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:08.520
Multicellular organisms, such as a cat,
have many billions of cells. These

2
00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:15.000
include somatic cells, shown here in
orange, and stem cells, shown here in

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.280
green. Somatic cells (from the Greek,
"soma", or body) make up the body of an

4
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:26.170
organism and are committed to
a specific cell fate. For example, the

5
00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:30.880
skin cell can divide to make more skin
cells, but not muscle cells or other

6
00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:36.120
types of cells. In contrast,
pluripotent stem cells ("pluri" means

7
00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:41.200
several, while "potent" means to be
able) can make any kind of cell, for

8
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.860
example, both skin and muscle cells.

9
00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:50.550
Pluripotent stem cells exist as part of
normal development embryos, but they do

10
00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:56.360
not exist in adults. So is it possible
to give adults pluripotent stem cells?

11
00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:03.140
In 2012, Dr. Shinya Yamanaka won the
Nobel Prize for discovering that adding

12
00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:10.610
the four genes, Myc, Oct3/4, Sox2, and
Klf4, into somatic cells leads to

13
00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:13.300
induced pluripotent stem cells, or
iPSCs.

14
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:20.550
Why is this so important in medicine?
Because iPSCs can grow continuously and

15
00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:23.460
give rise to every other cell type in
the body.

16
00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:29.930
It can be used to replace damaged cells
and tissues, such as in the case of

17
00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:35.540
muscle damage, contributing to the
field of regenerative medicine. Since

18
00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:41.130
iPSCs can be derived from adult somatic
cells, each individual patient could

19
00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:46.160
have their own stem cell line for organ
transplants, for example, to get a new

20
00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:51.960
liver. In addition, iPSCs can be used
to test what specific treatment works

21
00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:55.470
best for individual patients,
contributing to the field of

22
00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:56.950
personalized medicine.

